Package: com.fotobox.cupsd
Name: Fotobox CUPS daemon
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Fotobox
Author: Fotobox
Section: System
Description: On-device CUPS host for Fotobox USB (DNP) dye-sub printing on a
 jailbroken iOS device. Runs cupsd + the Gutenprint USB backend as a
 LaunchDaemon on 127.0.0.1:6310; the Fotobox app connects to it over IPP. The
 app itself stays sandboxed and App-Store-clean and never touches USB.
